File: runtest.c
Line: 4309
Function: load_xpath_expr
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: On namespace registration failure, the error path prints ns->prefix and ns->href with "%s". For default namespaces, ns->prefix is NULL; passing a NULL pointer to fprintf with "%s" dereferences NULL and crashes.

